ONS Complete</i>.<br /> <br /> <br /> THE SHARED ORIGINS SERIES</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">This series of mini-supplements for CHAMPIONS provides &quot;Origin Stories&quot; that players and GMs can use for many different characters. Coming up with character origins is work; reusable origin gimmicks help you spend more time on character backgrounds and motivations and less time explaining why they have super-powers in the first place. (Shared origins can also tie characters together and create story hooks.) Each supplement supplies background information and game mechanics for one shared origin story, a ready-to-play sample hero, and a selection of sample villains. Supplements stand alone to make it easier to plug the sample characters and origin story into your own superhero setting.</span></span></span></span></span></span><br /> <b>Attached Thumbnails</b><ul><li><a href=\"http://www.herogames.com/forums/uploads/monthly_08_2014/post-23412-0-49677300-1408728104.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"http://www.herogames.com/forums/uploads/monthly_08_2014/post-23412-0-49677300-1408728104_thumb.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a></li> <li>--------</li> </ul>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1175,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1175-dshomshak","user":"DShomshak","date":". 10-03-2014, 07:13 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1175-dshomshak","name":"DShomshak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"197"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}